sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (browser)
    participant CLI as Ingest CLI<br/>(app.ingest)
    participant Site as cpbl.com.tw
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant LLM as LLM<br/>(via LangChain)
    participant Embed as fastembed<br/>(local embedding model)
    participant Qdrant

    Note over CLI,Qdrant: Indexing, run once and again whenever the documents change

    CLI->>Site: Download the three rule PDFs
    Site-->>CLI: PDF files
    CLI->>CLI: Extract text, drop page numbers and running headers
    CLI->>CLI: Split into articles by article number,<br/>then split over-long articles into chunks
    CLI->>CLI: Prepend a citation header to each chunk
    CLI->>Embed: Embed every chunk
    Embed-->>CLI: Vectors
    CLI->>Qdrant: Recreate the collection and store<br/>vectors with citation metadata

    Note over User,Qdrant: Question answering, once per question

    User->>API: POST /api/chat {question, use_rag, rewrite, top_k}
    API-->>User: Open the SSE stream

    alt use_rag is true
        opt rewrite is true
            API->>LLM: Rewrite the question in rulebook terminology
            LLM-->>API: Rewritten query
            API-->>User: SSE event: rewrite
        end

        loop For the question and the rewritten query, concurrently
            API->>Embed: Embed the query
            Embed-->>API: Query vector
            API->>Qdrant: Similarity search, top k
            Qdrant-->>API: Chunks with scores
        end

        API->>API: Merge the results, keep the best score<br/>per chunk, take the top k
        API-->>User: SSE event: sources
        API->>LLM: System prompt, numbered chunks and the question
    else use_rag is false (comparison baseline)
        API->>LLM: System prompt and the question only
    end

    loop Until the answer is complete
        LLM-->>API: Answer fragment
        API-->>User: SSE event: token
    end

    Note over User: Render the answer. Each [n] citation<br/>links to its retrieved chunk and PDF page
